 <header class="article-header">
 <span class="article-category">Wellness</span>
 <h2 class="article-title" itemprop="name">How a Topical Roll-On Can Help Relieve Tension Headaches: The Science Behind Targeted Relief</h2>
 <div class="article-meta">
 <span class="article-date"><time itemprop="datePublished" datetime="2026-06-11">June 11, 2026</time></span>
