 <p>Just like humans, pets benefit dramatically from nano-enhanced hemp. Traditional hemp oil has the same absorption challenges in animals that it does in people. The compounds must pass through the digestive system, where stomach acids and liver metabolism break down much of the active material before it ever reaches the bloodstream.</p>

